Subject: [PATCH 19/35] README and project PDF: relay-timed transmit, logs and
 guards; M5StackTab5QMX+SharedOverNetwork.pdf

The README lists the relay-timed FT8/FT4 transmit, the I/Q pause, the CAT
and transmit logs and the PS0; guard, and the update kit's 19 patches. The
new project PDF covers the whole v1.18.0-NAS version: architecture, why the
data goes through a relay, the QMXR/1 protocol, the Synology and Raspberry
Pi relays with their installation, operation and maintenance scripts, the
FT8 burst timing comparisons, sources, and the driver and application
listings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
